        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Combination Locking Slide Bolt</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis Combination locking door slide bolt is surface mounted with one way screws. Supplied with a flush mount rim strike and mortise strike for easy installation in almost any application. With chrome plated brass dials and a rust resistant coating on the body of the lock, it stands up to harsh weather.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe new Combi-Bolt combines the simplicity of 4-digit encoding for a total of 10,000 possible combinations. Easy to install since the lock, sliding bolt and installation screws are all included in one convenient package. Whether you have a shed door, garden gate or cabinet the Combi-Bolt is the simple secure solution for you.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/CB2000-size.jpg?v=1704354713\" width=\"600\" height=\"200\" border=\"0\" alt=\"CB2000-BLK Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the CB2000-BLK Combination Locking Slide Bolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Metal</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Black</b></li>\r\n<li>Bolt Housing Length: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Bolt Housing Height: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Bolt Diameter: 3/8\"</li> \r\n<li>Bolt Throw: 9/16\"</li> \r\n<li>Door Bolt Strikes: Surface mounted Rim and Mortise Strike Plates</li>\r\n<li>Includes (6) One-Way mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/CB2000-BLK-install.pdf?v=1691095128\"><b>CB2000 Installation Instructions and Dimensional Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold Individually</b>\r\n</p>",
